== Bundled fonts

The fonts are the files Asciidoctor PDF 2.3.27 and prawn-icon 3.0.0 ship,
unmodified (stored zlib-compressed and ASCII85-encoded in the data_*.mbt
files by scripts/pdf_bundle_fonts.mbtx of the asciidoctor.mbt repository).
A PDF made with them embeds subsets of them; the font licenses do not apply
to such documents.

Noto Serif and Noto Sans (subsets) -- Apache License 2.0
  fonts/ (notoserif-*-subset.ttf), fonts/sans (notosans-*-subset.ttf).
  Google Noto fonts, https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-fonts, subset by
  the Asciidoctor PDF project. License: fonts/LICENSES/LICENSE-noto;
  provenance: fonts/LICENSES/ABOUT-notoserif-subset, ABOUT-notosans-subset.

Noto Emoji (subset) -- Apache License 2.0
