Font Awesome Free 5.15.1 (fonts) -- SIL Open Font License 1.1
  fonts/icons (fas/fa-solid.ttf, far/fa-regular.ttf, fab/fa-brands.ttf).
  Copyright (c) Fonticons, Inc., https://fontawesome.com. License:
