Icon names
  fonts/icons (<set>/glyphs.txt): each icon font's icon names and code
  points, generated by scripts/pdf_bundle_fonts.mbtx from the icon fonts'
  own projects:
  * fas, far, fab: the glyph names in the Font Awesome Free 5.15.1 fonts
    themselves (SIL OFL 1.1, as above), plus the code point of
    font-awesome-logo-full, which Font Awesome Free 5.15.1's metadata
    (metadata/icons.yml; Copyright (c) Fonticons, Inc., Font Awesome Free
    license, fonts/LICENSES/LICENSE-fontawesome;
    https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome) lists and the fonts lack.
  * fi: Foundation Icons 3.0's foundation-icons.css (MIT License, Made by
    ZURB 2013; https://github.com/zurb/foundation-icon-fonts).
  * pf: PaymentFont 1.2.5's sass/_variables.scss (MIT License, Copyright
    (c) 2017 Alexander Manfred Pöllmann;
    https://github.com/AlexanderPoellmann/PaymentFont). License:
    fonts/LICENSES/LICENSE-paymentfont-1.2.5.

